  "story": {
    "zh": "2035 年，Nova：Shadow Fault 制造了新的故障。任务：Shadow Fault 最终战役。诊断资源并恢复云城。",
    "ja": "2035年、Nova：Shadow Fault が障害を発生。任務：Shadow Fault 最終決戦。リソースを調べ都市を復旧せよ。",
    "en": "2035. Nova: Shadow Fault has caused another incident. Mission: Shadow Fault final battle. Diagnose the resources and restore the city."
  },
  "lesson": {
    "zh": "最终恢复依赖应用、网络、数据权限、容器、监控与安全；只修复一个服务不能通关。",
    "ja": "最終復旧はアプリ、ネットワーク、権限、コンテナ、監視、安全性を組み合わせて判定。",
    "en": "Final recovery combines application, networking, data access, containers, monitoring and safety; one repaired service is insufficient."
  },
